<title>ISRAEL: IDB Development 1996 net profit down.</title>
<headline>IDB Development 1996 net profit down.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>IDB Development Corp, a subsidiary of IDB Holding Corp.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels except per share)</p>
